{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10306","headline":"过刘员外长卿别墅 · 皇甫曾","name":"过刘员外长卿别墅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢客开山後，郊扉积水通。\n江湖千里别，衰老一尊同。\n返照寒川满，平田暮雪空。\n沧洲自有趣，不便哭途穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10306.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10306","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}